even have a psychotic break of some kind,

00:00:12.719 --> 00:00:15.759
maybe under pressure from the Corona virus
fiasco.

00:00:15.759 --> 00:00:22.289
And once again, proving that we are at public
health risk by having this man as president

00:00:22.289 --> 00:00:24.960
and at least nominally in charge of the Corona
virus response.

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:28.779
You know, if it's really Jared Kushner behind
the scenes or whoever.

00:00:28.779 --> 00:00:30.529
It's bad no matter what.

00:00:30.529 --> 00:00:33.150
Trump is at least nominally in charge.

00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:37.480
Look at what the president has spent the morning
