00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:44.560
MSNBC, saying, watch the first five minutes
of poorly rated morning psycho on MSA DNC

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:49.050
just to see if he is as nuts as people are
saying he's worse.

00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:50.540
Such hatred and contempt.

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:54.060
I used to do his show all the time before
the 2016 election.

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:55.420
Then cut him off.

00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:57.250
Wasn't worth the effort.

00:00:57.250 --> 00:00:59.160
His mind is shot then.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:03.120
Remember that yesterday nearly two thousand
Americans died.

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:06.810
Yesterday, the death toll was right around
1950.

00:01:06.810 --> 00:01:12.200
Trump insists everything is fine and tweets,
quote, It's amazing that I became president

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:18.090
of the United States with such a totally corrupt
and dishonest lame stream media going after

00:01:18.090 --> 00:01:20.299
