00:01:27.979 --> 00:01:33.259
Then, as the official number of cases in the
United States will pass 800000.

00:01:33.259 --> 00:01:39.359
Today, Trump tweets about his ratings saying,
quote, I've had great ratings my whole life.

00:01:39.359 --> 00:01:41.420
There's nothing unusual about that for me.

00:01:41.420 --> 00:01:46.829
The White House news conference ratings are
