00:02:02.509 --> 00:02:06.880
And then lastly, once again, Trump tweeting
about these phantom approval ratings among

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:07.880
Republicans.

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:09.270
We never know where they're coming from.

00:02:09.270 --> 00:02:13.070
