00:02:13.070 --> 00:02:18.190
channels saying, quote, Ninety six percent
approval rating in the Republican Party.

00:02:18.190 --> 00:02:19.350
Thank you.

00:02:19.350 --> 00:02:26.270
This must also mean that, most importantly,
we are doing a good, great job in the handling

00:02:26.270 --> 00:02:27.270
