00:02:27.270 --> 00:02:29.160
Now, the truth is the opposite.

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:34.070
In the last Gallup presidential approval poll,
I told you about this yesterday, a Trump's

00:02:34.070 --> 00:02:37.680
