poll.

00:02:37.680 --> 00:02:43.700
That's the fastest approval decline between
polls of Donald Trump's entire presidency.

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:45.000
But none of it matters.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:51.030
It's all a question of what can his followers
be convinced of.

00:02:51.030 --> 00:02:53.490
Nearly 2000 people died yesterday.

00:02:53.490 --> 00:02:56.310
We're passing eight hundred thousand cases
today.

00:02:56.310 --> 00:02:59.360
Testing has not actually increased for weeks.

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:04.510
And Trump spends the morning bragging about
ratings and attacking Mika Brzezinski and

00:03:04.510 --> 00:03:05.650
